  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">V Emotes Mod</span> 新增了可自訂的按鈕，用於觸發各種動作表情</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XDeNhhw.png\"></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:24px\">版本 2.7.2 需要 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/render-player-api/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">Render Player API<br><br></a></span></pre>\n<pre><span>我發現了一個 Bug，衣袖無法跟隨動畫動作，建議在皮膚設定中將其停用<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AnxTazw.png\"></span></pre>\n<pre>&nbsp;</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DGIMVOe.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C21n1ub.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OrcPBCf.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/icheoM3.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dOLr8Cu.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>如果您找不到 Render Player API 1.12.2 版本，請<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/r-player-api-2019/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此</a>下載 jar 檔案</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>特別感謝 MrCrayfish 及其開發直播頻道</strong></p>",
